<text xml:lang="sa-Latn-t-sa-Deva"><body>
  <p xml:id="GPV_scribal_namaskar">oṁ svasti prajābhyaḥ śrīgurave namaḥ ||</p>

  <p>oṁ</p>
<lg xml:id="GPV_1.1">
  <l>jagatsisṛkṣāpralayakriyāvidhau prayatnam unmeṣanimeṣavibhramam |</l>
  <l>vadanti yasyekṣaṇapadmapakṣmaṇāṃ parāya tasmai parameṣṭine namaḥ ||</l>
  </lg>
  <lg xml:id="GPV_1.2">
    <l> te subhāsvarasahasraraśmayo ye smaranti gaṇapāṭham aṣṭakāḥ |</l>
   <l>saṃsmṛtiś ca na vinopapadyate vṛttabandham iha pāṇiner api ||</l>
  </lg>
</body></text><standOff type="apparatus" corresp="#GPV_scribal_namaskar" source="alignments/GPV_scribal_namaskar.xml"><interp type="normalization">
